    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7exTTq",
      "title": "Add EFIX RWA tokens on Base: BRLE, sBRLE, efixDI",
      "author": "Ernesto711",
      "number": 1322,
      "body": "## Adding EFIX RWA tokens on Base\n\nThis PR adds three production-deployed tokens from the EFIX protocol (https://efix.finance), all live on Base mainnet (chainId 8453):\n\n| Folder    | Symbol  | Name                       | Base address                                  |\n|-----------|---------|----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------|\n| `BRLE`    | BRLE    | Brazilian Real Electronic  | `0x7D12a82E335EB2Be0789A33CE2EBF7Eb2bA782F6`  |\n| `sBRLE`   | sBRLE   | Staked BRLE                | `0xC65069694e32ef72CD94649BC5174DF9D18475D0`  |\n| `efixDI`  | efixDI  | efixDI Plus                | `0xF5cA55f3ea5Bcd180aEa6dF9E05a0E63A66f5608`  |\n\n### Issuer & legitimacy\n\nEFIX is a CVM-licensed Brazilian securitizer:\n- Resolution 88/2022 securitization license\n- Ato Declaratório 23.635/2025 (CVM)\n- Smart contracts audited by OpenZeppelin (March 2026, 15/15 findings resolved)\n- Monthly attestation by Harris & Trotter (chartered accountants)\n\n### What these tokens do\n\n- **BRLE** — Brazilian Real-pegged stablecoin, backed 1:1 by BRL in segregated custody, redeemable on-chain via the EFIX Peg Stability Module.\n- **sBRLE** — ERC-4626 yield vault on BRLE, accruing yield from regulated BRL-denominated investments.\n- **efixDI+** — Tokenized claim on Brazilian DI (interbank deposit) money-market fund shares, exposing the Brazilian CDI yield curve on-chain. Live as Morpho Blue collateral on Base.\n\n### Verification & live integrations\n\n- Contracts verified on BaseScan:\n  - https://basescan.org/address/0x7D12a82E335EB2Be0789A33CE2EBF7Eb2bA782F6\n  - https://basescan.org/address/0xC65069694e32ef72CD94649BC5174DF9D18475D0\n  - https://basescan.org/address/0xF5cA55f3ea5Bcd180aEa6dF9E05a0E63A66f5608\n- Live Morpho Blue market (efixDI / USDC): https://app.morpho.org/base/market/0x31d65cadef8eb085dd3bead61b987b3f86a7ac7d3e1f4763f6d4ec6a477d345a\n- DefiLlama: https://defillama.com/protocol/efixdi\n- Canonical Uniswap-format tokenlist: https://efix.finance/tokenlist.json\n\n### Notes\n\n- `nobridge: true` is set on all three — EFIX tokens are Base-native and not bridgeable via the standard OP-Stack canonical bridge (mint/burn is gated by the EFIX protocol itself).\n- The on-chain symbol of the third token is `efixDI` (no `+`). The \"+\" suffix is brand-side (\"efixDI Plus\"); the contract's `symbol()` returns `\"efixDI\"`.\n- Logos are 256×256 PNGs (~7 KB each) using the official EFIX hex mark in white over the per-token color (green / blue / purple).\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-24T11:38:56Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 42,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7fHcQX",
      "title": "Add IRON token (Base mainnet) — IronBridge governance token",
      "author": "IRONBRIDGE-Al",
      "number": 1323,
      "body": "## Token Details\n\n- **Name:** Iron\n- **Symbol:** IRON\n- **Decimals:** 18\n- **Chain:** Base mainnet\n- **Contract:** `0xBd072aBa9CAd9d573A5B3498f79B117DBeFdC7f4`\n- **Website:** https://wwwironbridge.org\n\n## Notes\n\n- Native Base token (not bridged from Ethereum), marked `nobridge: true`\n- Contract deployed and live on Base mainnet\n- Logo included as SVG (256x256)\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Added `data/IRON/data.json`\n- [x] Added `data/IRON/logo.svg`\n- [x] Token exists on Base mainnet at specified address\n- [x] `nobridge: true` set (Base-native, not a bridged L1 token)\n- [x] One token per PR",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
